window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Seventeen years after the events in Under Your Scars, Caroline makes her yearly visit to Meridian City and is taken on a heartbreaking and bittersweet journey that gives her something she's been searching for her entire life: closure.</p> <p><b>This is a sequel novella to Under Your Scars: A Dark Romance Novel, and the series must be enjoyed in order.</b></p>"; 
